6331539882230572e-05,-0.00011681827891152352,-2.50339189733495e-06],"request":{"active_prefix":"","input_ids":[151644,8948,198,2610,525,1207,16948,11,3465,553,54364,14817,13,1446,525,264,10950,17847,13,151645,198,151644,872,198,50,3948,279,3491,3019,553,3019,13,20678,697,1590,4226,304,1124,79075,90,1112,92,382,48336,594,15198,572,220,17,15,15,2849,4134,13,11201,374,7920,13,1913,1128,1899,315,279,2003,1521,806,15198,4399,30,151645,198,151644,77091,198],"messages":[{"content":"Solve the problem step by step. Give your final answer in \\boxed{...}.\n\nKim's birthday was 200 days ago. Today is Wednesday. On what day of the week did his birthday fall?","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"e207a4fbd1c51b48b4091b86909cfea833eac447d0fc7df8a56d1a4118f7633d"},"seconds":15.2515230178833,"seed":7907769660080409,"stop":"eos","text":"To solve this problem, we need to determine the day of the week 200 days ago from today, which is Wednesday.\n\n1. **Determine the number of weeks and extra days in 200 days:**\n   - Since a week has 7 days, we divide 200 by 7 to find how many full weeks and extra days are there in 200 days.\n   \\[\n   200 \\div 7 = 28 \\text{ weeks and } 4 \\text{ days remainder}\n   \\]\n   - This means 200 days is equivalent to 28 weeks and 4 extra days.\n\n2. **Identify the day of the week 200 days ago:**\n   - Today is Wednesday. To find the day 200 days ago, we need to move back 4 days from Wednesday.\n   - Counting backwards:\n     - 1 day before Wednesday is Tuesday.\n     - 2 days before Wednesday is Monday.\n     - 3 days before Wednesday is Sunday.\n     - 4 days before Wednesday is Saturday.\n\nTherefore, 200 days ago was a Saturday.\n\nThe final answer is \\boxed{Saturday}."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{Saturday}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
